    "detailed_description": "In brick blaster you have to keep your ball bouncing.  Lose your ball, you lose a life.  Pickup new guns from power-up bricks and mince through the rest.<br />\r\nThings get tougher as you progress.  <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWork your way up the leader board to become the master brick blaster.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game currently offers a single-player experience where you shoot and bounce your way through waves of blocks picking up more powerful weapons and power-up blocks.<br />\r\nPower-up blocks change the way the ball behaves and provides an advantage.  Gun pickups increase your arsenal with which to destroy the blocks faster.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOnline leader boards show how you rank vs other players.",
